<title>USA: Allmerica offers to buy Allmerica Property.</title>
<headline>Allmerica offers to buy Allmerica Property.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allmerica Financial Corp said Tuesday it had offered to buy the remaining stock in Allmerica Property &amp; Casualty Cos Inc that it did not already own for a total of $700 million in cash and stock.  </p>
<p>Allmerica said it had offered $16.59 in cash and 0.385 a share in its own stock for every share in Allmerica Property.</p>
<p>The remaining stake that it wants to acquire consists of 24.2 million shares.</p>
<p>Allmerica already owns about 35.5 million shares or 59.5 percent of Allmerica Property.</p>
</text>
